• 
Hydrolyzed Collagen: Strengthens skin barrier and maintains suppleness

• 
11 types of Hyaluronic Acids: Hydrates both inner and outer skin, promoting plumpness and moisture retention', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-PDRN-Hyaluron-100g.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-PDRN-Hyaluron-100g.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Anua Niacinamide 10 TXA 4 Serum for Brightening and Dark Spots', 'anua-niacinamide-10-txa-4-serum-for-brightening-and-dark-spots', '71120407', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Anua', 'A lightweight serum with 10% Niacinamide and 4% TXA that helps brighten skin, reduce dark spots, and improve overall clarity. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.', 'Bring out a radiant, balanced complexion with Anua Niacinamide 10 TXA 4 Serum. This gentle, watery serum combines 10% Niacinamide and 4% Tranexamic Acid (TXA) to help reduce dark spots, even skin tone, and improve overall clarity. Its lightweight, non-greasy texture makes it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.

Benefits:

• Brightens dull skin and reduces dark spots

• Improves skin clarity and balance

• Lightweight, non-greasy, and low-irritation formula

How to Use:

