• Gently pat in with your fingertips until fully absorbed

• Use morning and evening before applying oils or moisturizers

• During the day, follow with broad-spectrum SPF 30+ for protection

• Start gradually, increasing usage as your skin tolerates', 2500, 2500, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-Niacinamide-10-TXA.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-Niacinamide-10-TXA.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Daily Face Serum","Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Anua Azelaic Acid 10 Hyaluron Redness Soothing Serum', 'anua-azelaic-acid-10-hyaluron-redness-soothing-serum', '71120406', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Anua', 'Anua Azelaic Acid 10 Hyaluron Redness Soothing Serum is a lightweight, watery serum that hydrates sensitive, acne-prone skin while gently calming redness and irritation.', 'Anua Azelaic Acid 10 Hyaluron Redness Soothing Serum is a low-irritation formula designed to comfort and hydrate sensitive, acne-prone skin. Enriched with Azelaic Acid and Hyaluronic Acid, it helps reduce the look of redness caused by dryness, soothes troubled areas, and restores a healthier appearance. With its watery lightweight texture, the serum absorbs quickly without leaving stickiness, making it ideal for daily use. Clinically tested to be non-comedogenic and low-irritation, it delivers calm, refreshed, and balanced skin.', 2650, 2650, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-Azelaic-Hyaluron-10.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Serum-30ml-Azelaic-Hyaluron-10.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Anua Heartleaf 70 Daily Lotion', 'anua-heartleaf-70-daily-lotion', '71120410', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Anua', 'Anua Heartleaf 70 Daily Lotion is a lightweight milk lotion that hydrates dry, acne-prone skin while helping to balance the skin’s pH and prevent moisture loss.', 'Anua Heartleaf 70 Daily Lotion is a gentle, lightweight daily moisturizer enriched with 70% Heartleaf Extract to deliver deep hydration and maintain a healthy skin balance. Designed for dry and acne-prone skin, it helps restore the skin’s natural pH level, locks in moisture, and creates a protective layer to prevent water loss. With its refreshing milk lotion texture, it absorbs easily into the skin, leaving it soft, calm, and comfortably hydrated without feeling heavy or greasy.', 2450, 2450, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Moisture-Lotion-200ml-Heartleaf-70-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Moisture-Lotion-200ml-Heartleaf-70-1.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["daily lotion","Lotion","moisturizing lotion"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Anua 3 Ceramide Panthenol Moisture Barrier Cream', 'anua-3-ceramide-panthenol-moisture-barrier-cream', '71120409', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Anua', 'Anua 3 Ceramide Panthenol Moisture Barrier Cream is a gentle face moisturizer that hydrates, soothes, and strengthens the skin’s moisture barrier while calming dryness and irritation.', 'Anua 3 Ceramide Panthenol Moisture Barrier Cream is a hydrating face cream specially formulated for normal skin. Enriched with ceramides and panthenol, it helps maintain a strong skin barrier and reduces redness caused by dryness. The addition of Centella extract smooths and comforts the skin, leaving it refreshed and healthy-looking. With its lightweight cream texture, it provides 48 hours of long-lasting hydration, reduces transepidermal water loss by up to 92.93%, and calms irritation after just one use. Dermatologically tested to be non-comedogenic and non-irritating, this cream keeps skin soft, soothed, and well-protected.', 2850, 2850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Moisture-Cream-100ml-Ceramide3-Pathenol-5.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Moisture-Cream-100ml-Ceramide3-Pathenol-5.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["moisturizer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Anua Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad', 'anua-heartleaf-77-clear-pad', '71120411', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Anua', 'Anua Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad is a soothing cleansing pad infused with 77% Heartleaf Extract to calm sensitive skin, remove impurities, and refine pores for a fresh, balanced look.', 'Anua Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad is soaked in 77% Heartleaf Soothing Toner to gently remove dirt, excess oil, and impurities while tightening pores. Enriched with Korean Heartleaf Extract, it helps calm sensitive and irritated skin. The Anti Sebum P Complex works to control sebum production and improve skin texture, leaving your skin clean, refreshed, and soft without stripping away moisture.', 2100, 2100, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Clear-Pad-150ml-Heartleaf-77.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Anua-Clear-Pad-150ml-Heartleaf-77.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dr.Althea 345 Relief Cream', 'dr-althea-345-relief-cream', '71120402', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dr.Althea', 'Dr. Althea 345 Relief Cream is a lightweight, post-acne cream that nourishes, soothes, and hydrates the skin while reducing blemishes and redness. Gentle, non-greasy, and ideal for sensitive skin.', 'Dr. Althea 345 Relief Cream is a nutrient-rich gel cream designed to restore balance and improve skin health after acne. Its multi-layered structure provides long-lasting hydration and nourishment without feeling heavy. Formulated with 10,000ppm Niacinamide, Panthenol, and Opuntia Ficus-Indica Stem Extract, it strengthens the skin barrier, calms irritation, and replenishes moisture. The silky, refreshing texture absorbs quickly, making it suitable for daily use. Free from artificial colors and fragrances, this vegan-certified and EWG Green Grade-rated cream is perfect for sensitive, acne-prone, and dry skin types.

How to Use

• Cleanse your face with a gentle cleanser.

• Apply lighter skincare products (like toner or serum) first.

• Take an adequate amount of the 345 Relief Cream and gently spread it over your face as the final or semi-final step of your routine.

Benefits

• Soothes redness and calms irritated skin

• Fades acne marks and dark spots

• Strengthens the skin’s barrier and locks in hydration

• Non-greasy, lightweight, and absorbs quickly

• Gentle formula, suitable for sensitive skin

• Provides continuous hydration with plant-based hydrators and hyaluronic acid', 2650, 2650, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/345.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/345.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["moisturizer","post-acne recovery cream","relief cream"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('I’m From Rice Cream 50g', 'im-from-rice-cream-50g', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'I’m From', 'I’m From Rice Cream 50g is a ceramide-rich moisturizer with 41% rice bran essence that strengthens the skin barrier, controls sebum, and delivers long-lasting hydration while leaving the skin naturally radiant.', 'I’m From Rice Cream 50g is a nourishing ceramide moisturizer crafted with 41% rice bran essence from organic farms in Yeoju, Korea. This rich cream strengthens the skin barrier, locks in moisture, and helps regulate sebum for dry and combination skin. Infused with natural fatty acids and rice-derived ceramides, it provides deep hydration, improves elasticity, and promotes a healthy, glowing complexion. Using the Vacuum Distillation Extraction Method, it preserves the clean and effective nutrients from rice bran for maximum skincare benefits. Dermatologically tested, cruelty-free, vegan, and free from artificial fragrances and colors, it is safe for all skin types. Pair it with the I’m From Rice Serum for enhanced hydration and radiant skin.', 2750, 2350, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rice-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rice-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["moisturizer","moisturizer rice cream","rice cream"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('I’m From Rice Serum 30ml', 'im-from-rice-serum-30ml', '71120412', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'I’m From', 'I’m From Rice Serum 30ml is a lightweight, hydrating serum enriched with rice bud extract, gamma-oryzanol, and niacinamide. It revitalizes dull skin, deeply moisturizes, and improves elasticity, leaving your complexion radiant and refreshed', 'I’m From Rice Serum 30ml is a nourishing and revitalizing serum designed to bring radiance and hydration to tired, dull skin. Infused with gamma-oryzanol from rice buds, niacinamide, and rice bud extract, it enhances skin vitality while smoothing texture and boosting elasticity. Hyaluronic acid deeply hydrates, locking in moisture for a refreshed, supple complexion. Lightweight and fast-absorbing, the serum melts effortlessly into the skin, leaving a moist, glowing finish. Dermatologically tested and made with non-GMO ingredients, it is safe and gentle for all skin types. For best results, pair with other products from the I’m From Rice line, such as the rice cream, to maximize hydration and promote collagen production.', 2500, 2500, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rice-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rice-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["kbeauty","korean serum","rice serum","Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Medicube TXA + Niacinamide 15% Serum – 30ml', 'medicube-txa-niacinamide-15-serum-30ml', '71120437', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Medicube TXA + Niacinamide 15% Serum combines 5% TXA and 10% Niacinamide to brighten, even out skin tone, and provide deep hydration. Its lightweight formula smooths texture, enhances complexion, and leaves skin glowing for up to 72 hours.', 'Medicube TXA + Niacinamide 15% Serum is a powerful brightening and hydrating treatment designed for all skin types. Featuring 5% Tranexamic Acid (TXA) and 10% Niacinamide, it helps reduce uneven skin tone, minimize dark patches, and improve overall skin clarity. The serum also contains Albutin to further enhance brightness and 10-Layer Hyaluronic Acid with Panthenol to deeply hydrate and smooth skin texture. Lightweight and gentle, it is low-irritation tested and free from artificial fragrances, making it suitable for sensitive skin. Apply regularly for glowing, even-toned, and smooth skin.', 2100, 2100, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-TXA-Niacinamide-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-TXA-Niacinamide-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean &#8211; 30Ml', 'seoul-1988-eye-cream-retinal-liposome-4-fermented-bean-30ml', '71120433', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'SEOUL 1988', 'K Secret SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream with 4% Retinal Liposome and fermented bean extract restores vitality to the delicate eye area, reducing wrinkles, improving elasticity, brightening skin tone, and providing deep hydration with a lightweight, f', 'K Secret SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean is a high-performance eye care solution designed to rejuvenate and protect the delicate skin around your eyes. With 4% active retinal liposome, it stimulates collagen production, reduces fine lines and wrinkles, and visibly tightens skin. Enriched with fermented soybean extract, natural bakuchiol, vitamins C and E, and three types of peptides, it gently brightens dark circles and evens skin tone while providing antioxidant protection. Its light, creamy texture absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, delivering deep hydration and leaving the eye area soft, supple, and smooth. Ideal for sensitive skin, this eye cream provides effective, non-irritating care for a youthful, revitalized look.', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SEOUL-1988-Eye-Cream-Retinal-Liposome-4-Fermented-Bean.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SEOUL-1988-Eye-Cream-Retinal-Liposome-4-Fermented-Bean.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Eye Cream"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Purito Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++', 'purito-daily-soft-touch-sunscreen-spf50-pa', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito', 'Purito Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ is a lightweight, non-sticky sunscreen that provides broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection with no white cast. Gentle, hypoallergenic, and dermatologist-tested, it’s perfect for daily wear and out', 'Purito Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ delivers effortless, high-level protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays. With its smooth, non-sticky texture and zero white cast, this sunscreen blends seamlessly into the skin, making it ideal for everyday use. Formulated to be hypoallergenic and dermatologist-tested, it’s suitable even for sensitive skin. Whether you’re golfing, hiking, camping, or spending a day at the beach, this sunscreen provides 5-level outdoor defense while keeping your skin comfortable and protected. Apply as the final step of your skincare routine 15 minutes before sun exposure, and reapply as needed for lasting protection.', 2750, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Daily-Soft-touch-sunscreen.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Daily-Soft-touch-sunscreen.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Sunscreen"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Purito Hydro Wave Deep Sea Cream', 'purito-hydro-wave-deep-sea-cream', '71120443', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito', 'Purito Hydro Wave Deep Sea Cream is a lightweight, non-greasy moisturizer infused with Gangwondo Deep Sea Water to deeply hydrate, balance oil and moisture, and replenish dehydrated skin—perfect for sensitive skin.', 'Purito Hydro Wave Deep Sea Cream is a refreshing, deeply hydrating moisturizer designed to quench thirsty skin without leaving a greasy feel. Powered by pristine Gangwondo Deep Sea Water, it restores the skin’s oil-water balance, replenishes lost moisture, and helps maintain a healthy, radiant complexion. Hypoallergenic and dermatologist-tested, it is gentle enough for sensitive skin while delivering long-lasting hydration. Use it as part of your daily summer routine by applying after serum, or layer it under sunscreen and makeup for smooth, glowing skin all day. For an added hydration boost, pair it with the Hydro Wave Deep Sea Serum.', 2100, 2100, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hydro-Wave-Deep-Sea-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hydro-Wave-Deep-Sea-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["moisturizer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream', 'purito-mighty-bamboo-panthenol-cream', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito', 'Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream is a nourishing moisturizer that helps repair the skin barrier, recover blemishes, and boost natural glow with Bamboo Extract and Panthenol.', 'Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream is a skin-repairing moisturizer formulated with Bamboo Extract, which closely resembles the skin’s natural moisture, and Panthenol to strengthen the skin barrier. This soothing cream helps fade blemishes, restore hydration, and enhance your skin’s natural radiance. Use daily by applying evenly to the face and neck, or apply extra layers at night for deep hydration and a protective moisture seal. For best results, pair it with the Defence Barrier pH Cleanser to support overall skin barrier health.', 2750, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Mighty-Bamboo-Panthenol-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Mighty-Bamboo-Panthenol-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Daily Face Moisturizer","moisturizer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Serum Unscented', 'purito-seoul-wonder-releaf-centella-serum-unscented', '71120444', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito Seoul', 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Serum Unscented is a calming, fragrance-free serum that soothes sensitive skin in just seconds, reduces acne spots, and leaves a smooth, glowing finish.', 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Serum Unscented is a lightweight, fragrance-free serum designed to calm and restore sensitive skin. Enriched with Centella Asiatica extract, it helps diminish acne spots, relieves irritation within seconds, and strengthens the skin’s natural barrier. Its gentle formula absorbs quickly without stickiness, making it suitable for daily use on delicate skin. Apply after toner to lock in hydration and boost skin resilience, or use it as a priming step before makeup for a smoother, radiant base. For best results, pair it with the Wonder Releaf Centella Toner Unscented and Cream Unscented for the ultimate soothing routine.', 2450, 2450, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Serum-Unscented-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Serum-Unscented-1.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion SPF50+ PA++++', 'purito-wonder-releaf-centella-daily-sun-lotion-spf50-pa', '71120440', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito', 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion SPF50+ PA++++ provides powerful sun protection with a lightweight, moisturizer-like texture. Gentle on sensitive skin, it leaves a non-sticky, dewy finish without white cast while defending aga', 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion SPF50+ PA++++ is a skin-friendly sunscreen designed for daily protection. With a soft, moisturizer-like texture, it glides on effortlessly, leaving skin hydrated with a dewy, non-sticky finish. The formula is anti-pollution certified, helping shield skin from both UV damage and urban environmental stressors. Free from white cast and irritation, it’s hypoallergenic and dermatologist-tested, making it ideal for sensitive skin. Apply generously as the last step of your skincare routine for complete defense, or pair with the Wonder Releaf Centella Toner and Cream for the ultimate soothing routine.', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Daily-Sun-Lotion.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Daily-Sun-Lotion.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["sun lotion"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Cream', 'purito-wonder-releaf-centella-cream', '71120442', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Purito', 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Cream is a soothing moisturizer that calms redness, strengthens the skin barrier, and hydrates sensitive skin. Gentle, hypoallergenic, and dermatologist-tested, it’s perfect for daily relief and extra care when', 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Cream is a calming and hydrating moisturizer formulated with Centella Asiatica extract to instantly soothe and strengthen sensitive skin. Designed to reduce redness and irritation, this lightweight cream absorbs smoothly, leaving the skin soft, refreshed, and balanced. Hypoallergenic and dermatologist-tested, it’s safe for even delicate skin types. For everyday use, apply after serum as a nourishing moisturizer, or layer generously on stressed skin to double as a massage cream for instant relief. For the best results, pair it with the Wonder Releaf Centella Toner and Serum for a complete soothing skincare routine.', 1950, 1950, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Wonder-Releaf-Centella-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["cream","k beauty","moisturizer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Maybelline Poreless Jelly Up to 24H Hydrating Blur Primer', 'maybelline-poreless-jelly-up-to-24h-hydrating-blur-primer', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Maybelline', 'A lightweight, 24H hydrating blur primer with 2% niacinamide and Water Jelly Technology. Blurs pores, extends makeup wear, and leaves a fresh, skin-like finish without greasiness or white cast.', 'Maybelline Poreless Jelly Primer delivers up to 24 hours of hydration and pore-blurring perfection. Infused with 2% niacinamide, water break gel, and pore-minimizing polymers, it uses Water Jelly Technology for a refreshing, weightless feel. This non-greasy, silicone-free primer smooths skin, extends makeup wear, and layers effortlessly. No white cast, no pilling—just a natural, fresh look. Suitable for all skin types, even sensitive skin.', 2150, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Maybelline-PORELESS-JELLY-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Maybelline-PORELESS-JELLY-1.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dot & Key Strawberry Dew Tinted Sunscreen SPF 50+', 'dot-key-strawberry-dew-tinted-sunscreen-spf-50', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dot & Key', 'Dot & Key Strawberry Dew Tinted Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ gives instant radiance with light coverage and a natural finish. Enriched with niacinamide, it protects against tanning, fades dark spots over time, and leaves skin smooth without whi', 'Get sun protection and a radiant glow in one step with Dot & Key Strawberry Dew Tinted Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++. This ultra-light, non-comedogenic formula blends effortlessly into the skin, providing a natural finish with light coverage—no white cast, no heaviness. Infused with the brightening power of niacinamide, it not only shields against harmful UVA/UVB rays but also helps fade dark spots, even out skin tone, and check tanning over time.

Designed for daily wear, the fragrance-free formula leaves your skin instantly radiant, smooth, and protected, making it perfect as a standalone product or under makeup. With SPF 50+ broad-spectrum protection and skincare benefits, it’s the ultimate multitasking sunscreen for healthy, glowing skin.', 875, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dot-Key.jpeg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dot-Key.jpeg"]'::jsonb, 'Sunscreen Shade', '["00 Peony","01 Porcelain","01A Rose","02 Warm Ivory","03 Sand"]'::jsonb, '["Sunscreen"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Sunscreen SPF 50+', 'dot-key-blueberry-hydrate-barrier-repair-sunscreen-spf-50', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dot & Key', 'Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Sunscreen SPF 50+ provides broad-spectrum protection with a lightweight, non-greasy formula. Enriched with ceramides, rice bran oil, niacinamide, and hyaluronic acid, it hydrates, repairs the skin', 'Protect and nourish your skin with Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Sunscreen SPF 50+, a multi-tasking sunscreen designed for daily wear. Offering broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection, this dermatologically tested formula goes beyond sun defense to actively repair and strengthen your skin’s barrier. The lightweight, fast-absorbing texture ensures a non-greasy, comfortable finish—perfect for everyday use.

Powered by skin-loving ingredients, ceramides help restore the natural barrier and lock in moisture, rice bran oil delivers antioxidant protection, niacinamide refines skin texture and minimizes pores, while hyaluronic acid deeply hydrates for a plump, refreshed look. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, this sunscreen keeps your skin moisturized, bright, and shielded throughout the day. For best results, apply generously as the last step of your skincare routine and reapply every 2–3 hours.', 950, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blueberry-Hydrate-Barrier-Repair-Sunscreen.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blueberry-Hydrate-Barrier-Repair-Sunscreen.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Sunscreen"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Rice Water Toner', 'dot-key-blueberry-hydrate-barrier-repair-rice-water-toner', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dot & Key', 'Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Rice Water Toner instantly hydrates, tightens pores, and soothes irritation with its alcohol-free formula. Enriched with blueberry and rice water, it balances the skin’s microbiome for a refreshed, healthy g', 'Give your skin the care it deserves with the Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Rice Water Toner. Infused with the nourishing power of blueberry and rice water, this alcohol-free toner provides instant hydration while strengthening your skin’s natural barrier. It helps unclog and tighten pores, balances the skin’s microbiome, and calms irritation for a smoother, healthier-looking complexion. Gentle yet effective, it prepares your skin to absorb moisturizer better and keeps it feeling refreshed throughout the day. Use daily after cleansing for skin that feels soft, soothed, and radiant—don’t forget SPF in the morning for complete protection.', 630, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blueberry-Hydrate-Barrier-Repair-Rice-Water-Toner.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blueberry-Hydrate-Barrier-Repair-Rice-Water-Toner.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["rice toner","toner"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Cerave Diabetics Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream', 'cerave-diabetics-dry-skin-relief-moisturizing-cream', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'CeraVe', 'CeraVe Diabetics’ Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream was developed with dermatologists to provide soothing 48-hour hydration for diabetics’ dry skin.', 'CeraVe Diabetics’ Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream was developed with dermatologists to provide soothing 48-hour hydration for dry skin, and has three essential ceramides to help restore the skin’s protective barrier, urea to help draw moisture from the environment into your skin and bilberry to help provide antioxidant benefits.

Ingredients that can help hydrate diabetics’ dry skin include ceramides that help restore the skin’s barrier to prevent moisture loss and urea that helps attract and retain moisture. CeraVe Diabetics’ Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream features both of these ingredients to leave diabetics’ es dry skin feeling soft and smooth .', 2750, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Diabetics-Dry-Skin-Relief-Moisturizing-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Diabetics-Dry-Skin-Relief-Moisturizing-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('SEOUL 1988 Essence Snail Mucin 97% + Rice', 'seoul-1988-essence-snail-mucin-97-rice', '71120434', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'nail-care'), 'SEOUL 1988', 'Seoul 1988 Essence Snail Mucin 97% + Rice – Moisturizing and brightening serum with snail mucin and rice extracts. Hydrates, smooths, and enhances skin radiance.', 'Revitalize and hydrate your skin with Seoul 1988 Essence Snail Mucin 97% + Rice. Formulated with 97% snail mucin, renowned for its healing and moisturizing benefits, this serum deeply nourishes and repairs skin. Enriched with rice extract, rice water, and rice ferment filtrate, it helps brighten the complexion, smooth texture, and lock in hydration for a supple, radiant finish. Lightweight and fast-absorbing, this essence is perfect for daily use, leaving skin refreshed, soft, and glowing.', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SEOUL-1988-Essence-Snail-Mucin-97-Rice.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SEOUL-1988-Essence-Snail-Mucin-97-Rice.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Medicube TXA Niacinamide Capsule Cream 55g', 'medicube-txa-niacinamide-capsule-cream-55g', '71120438', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Medicube TXA Niacinamide Capsule Cream 55g – Radiance-boosting cream with TXA, niacinamide, and alpha-arbutin. Brightens, hydrates, and refines uneven skin tone for smooth, glowing skin.', 'Boost your skin’s radiance with Medicube TXA Niacinamide Capsule Cream 55g. This gentle, non-comedogenic cream is packed with tranexamic acid, niacinamide, and alpha-arbutin capsules to hydrate, brighten, and improve uneven skin tone. It leaves the skin soft, smooth, and refreshed while enhancing clarity and promoting a healthy, natural glow. Clinically tested, it delivers noticeable improvements in radiance, hydration, and balanced skin tone after a single use. Suitable for all skin types, especially blemish-prone skin, this cream is perfect for daily use to achieve clearer, luminous, and nourished skin.', 2950, 2950, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-TXA-Niacinamide-Capsule-Cream.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-TXA-Niacinamide-Capsule-Cream.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["hydrating cream"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Medicube Triple Collagen Serum [55ml]', 'medicube-triple-collagen-serum-55ml', '71120436', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Medicube Triple Collagen Serum – Lightweight serum with Triple Collagen Complex, niacinamide, and hyaluronic acid. Boosts elasticity, hydrates, and brightens skin for a radiant, youthful look.', 'Enhance your skin’s elasticity and radiance with Medicube Triple Collagen Serum 4.0. This lightweight serum features a Triple Collagen Complex—hydrolyzed collagen, atelo collagen, and soluble collagen—that penetrates deeply to nourish and plump the skin. Infused with niacinamide for brightening and hyaluronic acid for hydration, it helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. The creamy, milky texture absorbs quickly, leaving skin soft, supple, and non-sticky. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, it’s perfect for daily use after cleansing and toning.', 2350, 2350, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-Triple-Collagen-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-Triple-Collagen-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Dr.Althea Vitamin C Boosting Serum [30ml]', 'dr-althea-vitamin-c-boosting-serum-30ml', '71120435', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dr.Althea', 'Dr.Althea Vitamin C Boosting Serum [30ml] – Brightening, gentle serum with niacinamide, 3-O ethyl ascorbic acid, and Vitamin C-rich hippophae rhamnoides. Fades dark spots, evens skin tone, and soothes sensitive skin.', 'Revitalize your complexion with Dr.Althea Vitamin C Boosting Serum [30ml]. Enriched with niacinamide, 3-O ethyl ascorbic acid, and Vitamin C-rich hippophae rhamnoides fruit extract, this gentle serum helps fade hyperpigmentation, smoothen skin texture, and restore a radiant glow. Camellia sinensis leaf water soothes sensitive skin, while the watery, fast-absorbing formula leaves no sticky residue. Vegan and made with EWG Green-grade ingredients, it’s free from artificial colorants and scents, making it safe for daily use. Achieve brighter, even-toned, and nourished skin with this revitalizing vitamin C serum.', 2150, 2150, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Dr-Althea-Vitamin-C-Boosting-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Dr-Althea-Vitamin-C-Boosting-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Eqqualberry Vitamin Illuminating Serum [30ml]', 'eqqualberry-vitamin-illuminating-serum-30ml', '71120448', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Eqqualberry', 'Eqqualberry Vitamin Illuminating Serum [30ml] – Brightening vitamin serum with 40% Acerola. Reduces dark spots, evens skin tone, and is safe for sensitive skin.', 'Revitalize dull skin with Eqqualberry Vitamin Illuminating Serum [30ml]. Infused with 40% Acerola extract, this potent vitamin serum helps reduce dark spots, brightens your complexion, and evens out skin tone. Clinically tested in 13 trials, it’s safe for sensitive skin and addresses dryness, hyperpigmentation, uneven texture, and sensitivity. Lightweight and fast-absorbing, it delivers nourishing care while enhancing your skin’s natural radiance. Make it a daily step in your skincare routine for healthier, luminous, and visibly brighter skin.', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Vitamin-illuminating-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Vitamin-illuminating-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Eqqualberry Bakuchiol Plumping Serum [30ml]', 'eqqualberry-bakuchiol-plumping-serum-30ml', '71120447', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Eqqualberry', 'Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Ampoule – Vegan, fast-absorbing ampoule with multiple hyaluronic acids and 5-Cica blend. Hydrates, soothes, and reduces the appearance of pores.', 'Give your skin a hydration boost with Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Ampoule. This vegan, moisturizing ampoule combines multiple types of hyaluronic acid to deliver deep, long-lasting hydration for dry and irritated skin. Infused with a 5-Cica blend, including Centella Asiatica Extract and Madecassoside, it calms sensitive skin while helping to reduce the appearance of enlarged pores. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing formula leaves skin refreshed, supple, and non-sticky, making it an ideal step in your daily skincare routine for healthier, balanced, and nourished skin.', 2350, 2350, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bakuchiol-Plumping-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bakuchiol-Plumping-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Ampoule', 'eqqualberry-swimming-pool-ampoule', '71120446', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Eqqualberry', 'Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Ampoule – Vegan, fast-absorbing ampoule with multiple hyaluronic acids and 5-Cica blend. Hydrates, soothes, and reduces the appearance of pores.', 'Give your skin a hydration boost with Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Ampoule. This vegan, moisturizing ampoule combines multiple types of hyaluronic acid to deliver deep, long-lasting hydration for dry and irritated skin. Infused with a 5-Cica blend, including Centella Asiatica Extract and Madecassoside, it calms sensitive skin while helping to reduce the appearance of enlarged pores. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing formula leaves skin refreshed, supple, and non-sticky, making it an ideal step in your daily skincare routine for healthier, balanced, and nourished skin.', 2050, 2050, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Swimming-pool-Ampoule.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Swimming-pool-Ampoule.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["ampoule"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Daily Facial Toner', 'eqqualberry-swimming-pool-daily-facial-toner', '71120445', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Eqqualberry', 'Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Daily Facial Toner – Low-pH, hypoallergenic toner with 5 Berry Complex and 8-layer hyaluronic acids. Gently exfoliates, hydrates, and nourishes sensitive skin.', 'Refresh and nourish your skin with Eqqualberry Swimming Pool Daily Facial Toner. This hypoallergenic, low-pH toner gently exfoliates dead skin cells and unclogs pores while delivering deep hydration with 8 stacked hyaluronic acids. Enriched with a 5 Berry Complex, including blueberry and cranberry extracts, it provides antioxidant and anti-aging benefits for a healthier, glowing complexion. Naturally derived protease enzymes ensure mild exfoliation, and the alcohol-, paraben-, and benzene-free formula is safe for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Made with EWG Green-grade ingredients, it’s the perfect toner for daily skin renewal.', 2950, 2450, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Swimming-pool-toner.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Swimming-pool-toner.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["facial toner","swimming pool toner","toner"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask', 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-poremizing-quick-clay-stick-mask', '71120431', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Skin', 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask – Convenient stick mask with 5 clays and red bean powder. Deeply cleans pores, controls sebum, and gently exfoliates.', 'Simplify your skincare routine with the Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask. This innovative stick mask features 5 types of clay, including 18% high-density kaolin, to reduce sebum by up to 87% in a single application. Its finely crushed red bean powder gently exfoliates dead skin cells while targeting blackheads and whiteheads deeply embedded in pores. The convenient stick format allows mess-free application without touching your hands, making it perfect for all skin types—including sensitive skin. Wash off easily to reveal smoother, clearer, and refreshed skin with every use.', 1850, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Poremizing-Quick-Clay-Stick-Mask-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Poremizing-Quick-Clay-Stick-Mask-1.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Clay Mask","Face Masks"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum &#8211; 100ml', 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-hyalu-cica-water-fit-sun-serum-100ml', '71120430', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Skin1004', 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum SPF50 PA++++ – Lightweight, watery SPF serum with hyaluronic acid and Centella Asiatica. No white cast, non-greasy, dewy finish.', 'Protect and hydrate your skin with Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum SPF50 PA++++ (50 ml). This lightweight, watery serum combines hyaluronic acid and Madagascar Centella Asiatica to provide broad-spectrum sun protection while delivering deep hydration and soothing benefits. Its fast-absorbing texture blends effortlessly with no white cast or greasy residue, leaving your skin dewy, supple, and refreshed. Perfect for daily use, this SPF serum keeps sensitive and normal skin protected, nourished, and glowing throughout the day.', 3350, 3150, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SKIN-1004-Madagascar-Centella-Hyalu-Cica-Water-Fit-Sun-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SKIN-1004-Madagascar-Centella-Hyalu-Cica-Water-Fit-Sun-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule &#8211; 100ml', 'skin1004-hyalu-cica-first-ampoule-100ml', '71120428', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Skin1004', 'Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule 100 ml – Step 0 watery ampoule with 5 hyaluronic acids, birch sap, and ivy. Instantly hydrates, soothes, and preps sensitive, normal, and dry skin.', 'Hydrate and prep your skin with Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule 100 ml. This Step 0 watery ampoule, enriched with 5 types of hyaluronic acid, birch sap, and ivy, delivers deep, long-lasting moisture while calming irritation and strengthening the skin barrier. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture leaves skin refreshed, soft, and supple, making it perfect for sensitive, normal, and dry skin types. With 100 ml of hydration power, this ampoule ensures your skin stays balanced and nourished as the essential first step in your daily skincare routine.', 2450, 2450, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hyalu-Cica-First-Ampoule-100ml.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hyalu-Cica-First-Ampoule-100ml.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule &#8211; 50ml', 'skin1004-hyalu-cica-first-ampoule-50ml', '71120614', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Skin1004', 'Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule – Step 0 moisture ampoule with 5 hyaluronic acids, birch sap, and ivy. Instantly hydrates, soothes, and preps sensitive, normal, and dry skin.', 'Start your skincare routine with Skin1004 Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule, a lightweight watery ampoule designed to instantly boost moisture and prep your skin for the next step. Infused with 5 types of hyaluronic acid, birch sap, and ivy, it delivers deep hydration, calms irritation, and strengthens the skin barrier. Its fast-absorbing, watery texture ensures your skin feels refreshed, soft, and supple without heaviness. Perfect for sensitive, normal, and dry skin types, this Step 0 ampoule sets the foundation for healthier, hydrated, and more resilient skin every day.', 1750, 1750, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hyalu-Cica-First-Ampoule-50ml.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Hyalu-Cica-First-Ampoule-50ml.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Daily Face Moisturizer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Medicube Deep Vita C Capsule Cream', 'medicube-deep-vita-c-capsule-cream', '71120401', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Brighten and smooth your skin with Medicube’s Deep Vita C Capsule Cream, packed with 500,000ppm vitamin tree extract, Vitamin C capsules, and 5 derivatives for a glowing, hydrated, and even-toned complexion—gentle enough for sensitive skin.', 'Energize your complexion with Medicube’s Deep Vita C Capsule Cream, a powerful yet gentle brightening moisturizer designed to tackle dullness, dark spots, and uneven texture. Infused with 500,000ppm vitamin tree extract, Vitamin C capsules, and five stabilized Vitamin C derivatives, it works to enhance radiance, boost firmness, and deeply hydrate your skin. The gel-and-capsule texture preserves potency until absorption, ensuring maximum results without irritation. Dermatologically tested and suitable for sensitive skin, this cream refines, smooths, and restores your natural glow while addressing fine lines and dehydration.', 2650, 2650, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-1.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Medicube PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream', 'medicube-pdrn-pink-collagen-capsule-cream', '71120400', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Revive dull, sagging skin with Medicube’s PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream. Powered by salmon PDRN, collagen, hyaluronic acid, and niacinamide, this lightweight formula brightens, firms, and deeply hydrates—perfect for all skin types, even', 'Give your skin a firm, radiant boost with Medicube’s PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream. Infused with salmon-derived PDRN, collagen, hyaluronic acid, and niacinamide, this innovative capsule cream works to improve uneven skin tone, enhance elasticity, and lock in lasting hydration. The pink collagen capsules preserve active ingredients until they melt into your skin for maximum glow and firming results. Lightweight yet nourishing, it strengthens the skin barrier, smooths texture, and leaves your complexion looking luminous and healthy. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.', 2950, 2950, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Medicube Collagen Night Wrapping Mask', 'medicube-collagen-night-wrapping-mask', '71120399', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Medicube', 'Wake up to firmer, dewier skin with Medicube’s Collagen Night Wrapping Mask. This easy-to-peel overnight film locks in moisture and nutrients for 8 hours, boosting elasticity and refining texture—clinically tested for sensitive skin.', 'Transform your nighttime skincare into an intensive collagen treatment with Medicube’s Collagen Night Wrapping Mask. Designed to create a breathable film over your skin, it locks in moisture and nutrients while you sleep, delivering 8 hours of continuous care. Enriched with rich collagen, this mask helps improve elasticity, hydration, and overall skin texture within two weeks. The next morning, simply peel off the film in one piece to reveal a refreshed, firmer, and more resilient complexion. Clinically tested and suitable for sensitive skin, it’s the perfect way to awaken your glow.', 2250, 2250, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-2.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Medicube-2.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('L.A. Colors Lip Oil', 'l-a-colors-lip-oil', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'L.A.', 'An ultra-hydrating lip oil with gold flakes that leaves lips soft, glossy, and slightly tinted.', 'Give your lips some love with L.A. Colors Lip Oil. This nourishing formula hydrates and revitalizes, leaving lips feeling soft and supple. Infused with gold flakes for a subtle sparkle and a hint of tint, it also offers a delightful, unique scent with every application. Perfect for a natural, glossy look or layering over your favorite lipstick for extra shine.', 350, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Tangerina.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Tangerina.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Color', '["Berry Brust","Sweetie","Tangerine Twist"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('L.A. Colors Roll-On Lip Oil', 'l-a-colors-roll-on-lip-oil', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'L.A.', 'A moisturizing lip oil with gold flakes for a smooth feel and radiant shine.', 'L.A. Colors Roll-On Lip Oil pampers your lips with a nourishing, lightweight formula that glides on effortlessly. Infused with gold flakes, it delivers a subtle sparkle and glossy finish while keeping your lips soft and hydrated. Perfect for adding a touch of glamour to your everyday look or layering over your favorite lip color for extra shine.', 350, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Sheer-Pink.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Sheer-Pink.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Color', '["Sheer Berry","Sheer Pink"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Absolute New York Supreme Slim Demi-Matte Lipstick', 'absolute-new-york-supreme-slim-demi-matte-lipstick', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Absolute', 'A creamy, highly pigmented demi-matte lipstick that delivers bold color and a smooth, comfortable feel.', 'Absolute New York’s Supreme Slim Demi-Matte Lipstick combines intense pigmentation with a lightweight, creamy texture for a flawless application. From the very first swipe, it coats your lips in rich color while its demi-matte finish adds a touch of radiance. Designed to enhance your natural contours, this lipstick comes in a versatile range of feminine shades to suit every mood and style.', 895, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/desertniris.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/desertniris.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Color', '["Azalea","Desert iris","Poppy-filed"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Wet n Wild Color Icon Lipliner', 'wet-n-wild-color-icon-lipliner', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Wet', 'A creamy, long-lasting lipliner that defines, shapes, and prevents color from feathering.', 'Wet n Wild Color Icon Lipliner offers rich pigmentation and a silky-smooth glide for precise, comfortable application. Its versatile formula helps prevent feathering, enhances your lip shape, and can be worn alone or under your favorite lipstick for a flawless finish that lasts.', 275, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/wt-n-wild-willow.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/wt-n-wild-willow.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Shades', '["Berry Red","Willow"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Wet n Wild MegaSlicks Lip Gloss &#8211; Pink Champagne', 'wet-n-wild-megaslicks-lip-gloss-pink-champagne', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Wet', 'A high-shine tinted lip gloss with a hydrating formula for soft, fuller-looking lips.', 'Wet n Wild MegaSlicks Lip Gloss in Pink Champagne Please delivers brilliant shine, vibrant color, and deep hydration in one swipe. Infused with Jojoba Glaze, Maxi Lip peptides, Hyaluronic Acid, and Collagen, this gloss smooths, plumps, and nourishes your lips while leaving them irresistibly soft. Its lightweight, non-sticky formula makes it perfect for everyday wear, adding a radiant finish that enhances your natural pout.', 495, 465, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/wt-n-wild-lip-goss.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/wt-n-wild-lip-goss.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi Color Magnifier', 'bellaoggi-color-magnifier-2', '71425007', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Bellaoggi', 'Bellaoggi Color Magnifier lip balm acts on hydration level of the lips, revealing a natural and luminous colour increasing instantly the lip brightness.', 'Not a lipstick, not a lip gloss! Thanks to its color-enhancing technology, Color Magnifier lip balm acts on hydration level of the lips, revealing a natural and luminous colour increasing instantly the lip brightness. ​

​The entire collection contains the active PH reagent which, when in contact with the lips, reveals your unique and inimitable colour. ​

Super hydrating formula leaves lips soft as if wrapped in a cuddle. Extremely sensorial texture , pleasant to pass and repeat whenever you want.', 1750, 1750, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pink-flambe-color-magnifier3.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/pink-flambe-color-magnifier3.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["001 CLOUD DANCER","002 ROSE SHADOW","003 PINK FLAMBE","006 BLACKBERRY"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi Volume Boost', 'bellaoggi-volume-boost', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Bellaoggi', 'Bellaoggi Volume Boost is the plumping lip balm that gives instant volume to the lips in just a few minutes and saturating the colour with a natural blush.', 'Bellaoggi Volume Boost is the plumping lip balm that gives instant volume to the lips in just a few minutes and saturating the colour with a natural blush. The natural origin vegan formula with functional ingredients gives both an immediate and long-term plumping effect, promoting collagen synthesis amd hydration, increasing firmness and reducing the appearance of fine lines, while 2 blends of patented and tested raw materials ensure an immediate plumping effect throughout the stimulation of the microcirculation.', 1950, 1750, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Volume-Boost.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Volume-Boost.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Loreal Super Liner Black Lacquer Eyeliner Waterproof', 'loreal-super-liner-black-lacquer-eyeliner-waterproof', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Loreal', 'Create bold, smudge-proof lines with L’Oréal Super Liner Black Lacquer. This waterproof eyeliner features a sponge-tip applicator for easy control and precise definition—perfect for any look, from subtle lines to dramatic wings.', 'L’Oréal Paris Super Liner Black Lacquer Eyeliner delivers intense, long-lasting definition with a glossy black finish that dries down to a smudge-proof look. Its unique sponge-tip applicator glides effortlessly for controlled application—ideal for fine lines, bold wings, or anything in between. The waterproof, quick-drying formula resists smudging, even on oily skin, and stays put for hours. Suitable for sensitive eyes and contact lens wearers, this eyeliner offers precision, comfort, and dramatic results in just one stroke.', 1600, 1495, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Black-Liner.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Black-Liner.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Loreal Gylcolic Bright Dark Spot Brightening Face Serum', 'loreal-gylcolic-bright-dark-spot-brightening-face-serum', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Loreal', 'Fade dark spots and reveal radiant skin with L’Oréal Glycolic Bright Serum. Powered by 8% Melasyl™, glycolic acid, and niacinamide, it visibly reduces up to 77% of spots, sun damage, and acne marks. Suitable for all Indian skin tones.', 'L’Oréal Paris Glycolic Bright Dark Spot Brightening Serum combines cutting-edge science with skincare. Featuring 8% Melasyl™—a breakthrough molecule developed after 18 years of research—alongside glycolic acid and niacinamide, this serum targets dark spots, sunspots, acne marks, and uneven skin tone. Clinically proven to reduce up to 77% of discoloration, the lightweight, non-sticky formula absorbs quickly to deliver visibly brighter, even-toned skin. Dermatologically tested and suitable for sensitive and Indian skin types.', 1195, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Dark-Spot-Bright.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Dark-Spot-Bright.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Loreal Glycolic Bright Eye Serum for Dark Circles', 'loreal-glycolic-bright-eye-serum-for-dark-circles', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Loreal', 'Brighten and depuff tired eyes with L’Oréal Glycolic Bright Eye Serum. Reduces dark circles by up to 49% in 2 weeks with 3% Glycolic Acid, Vitamin CG, and Niacinamide.', 'L’Oréal Paris Glycolic Bright Eye Serum targets dark circles, puffiness, and under-eye pigmentation with a potent formula of 3% Glycolic Acid, Vitamin CG, and Niacinamide. Its patented Triple Bead Applicator soothes and depuffs while visibly reducing dark circles by up to 49% in just 2 weeks. Wake up to brighter, well-rested-looking eyes every day.', 1115, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Eye-Serum.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loreal-Paris-Eye-Serum.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Eye Serum"]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Loreal Voluminous Panorama Mascara', 'loreal-voluminous-panorama-mascara', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Loreal', 'Get panoramic volume from corner to corner with L’Oréal Panorama Mascara. Smudge-proof, clump-free, and flake-resistant for up to 24 hours. Perfect for sensitive eyes.', 'L’Oréal Voluminous Panorama Mascara delivers full, fanned-out lashes with up to 1.4x bigger-looking eyes. Its multi-level bristle brush coats each lash from root to tip for even, corner-to-corner volume. This waterproof mascara resists smudging, clumping, and flaking for up to 24 hours. Safe for sensitive eyes and ophthalmologist tested.', 1950, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loral-Panorama.jpeg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Loral-Panorama.jpeg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["mascara"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('YC White Sunscreen Spray SPF 50+', 'yc-white-sunscreen-spray-spf-50', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), NULL, 'Stay sun-safe with YC White Sunscreen Spray SPF 50+! A light, refreshing spray that offers strong UV protection while keeping your skin soft and calm.', 'YC White Sunscreen Spray SPF 50+ is your go-to protection for sunny days. Its light and dry formula absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue behind. Enriched for gentle moisturizing, this refreshing tone-up spray shields your skin from harmful UVA and UVB rays, making it perfect for daily use and all outdoor activities. Spray it on and step out with confidence!', 650, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Kids-white-refreshing.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Kids-white-refreshing.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('YC White Toneup Sunscreen Spray', 'yc-white-toneup-sunscreen-spray', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), NULL, 'Stay sun-safe and shine-free with YC White Tone Up Sunscreen Spray SPF 50+. Lightweight, quick-drying, and perfect for daily outdoor use!', 'Protect your skin from harmful UV rays with the YC White Tone Up Sunscreen Spray SPF 50+. This gentle, lightweight spray provides powerful sun protection while brightening your skin tone for a fresh, even look. Its dry-touch formula makes it ideal for all skin types and daily outdoor activities—without the greasy feel. Easy to apply and perfect for on-the-go skincare.', 650, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/YC-Spray.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/YC-Spray.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dot n Key Barrier Repair Hydrating Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++', 'dot-n-key-barrier-repair-hydrating-sunscreen-spf-50-pa', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Dot', 'Features :

• Broad-Spectrum Protection: SPF 40 PA+++ to shield against harmful UVA/UVB rays

• Barrier Repairing: Strengthens the skin’s natural protective barrier

• Lightweight Formula: Non-greasy, fast-absorbing, and comfortable for dai', 'Features :

• Broad-Spectrum Protection: SPF 40 PA+++ to shield against harmful UVA/UVB rays

• Barrier Repairing: Strengthens the skin’s natural protective barrier

• Lightweight Formula: Non-greasy, fast-absorbing, and comfortable for daily use

• Hydrating: Keeps skin moisturized and soft

• Dermatologically Tested: Gentle and safe for all skin types, including sensitive skin

Key Ingredients :

• Ceramides: Restores and strengthens the skin barrier, reducing water loss.

• Rice Bran Oil: Packed with antioxidants and nutrients to nourish and protect.

• Niacinamide: Brightens skin, minimizes pores, and improves skin texture.

• Hyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates, keeping the skin plump and fresh.

Usage :

• Step 1: Apply generously to clean, dry skin as the last step of your skincare routine

• Step 2: Spread evenly over the face, neck, and any exposed areas 15 minutes before sun exposure

• Step 3: Reapply every 2-3 hours, especially after swimming, sweating, or towel drying', 710, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Dot-and-Key.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Dot-and-Key.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Loreal INFAILLIBLE 3-SECOND Makeup SETTING Spray', 'loreal-infaillible-3-second-makeup-setting-spray', '71104002', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Loreal', 'Up to 36H wear in just one spray. New professional-inspired aerosol format that instantly dries. Transfer and sweat-resistant wear. Feels lightweight.', 'Up to 36H wear in just one spray. New professional-inspired aerosol format that instantly dries. Transfer and sweat-resistant wear. Feels lightweight.

• Microfine mist for up to 36Hr wear in just one spray

• New professional-inspired microfine aerosol mist format that instantly dries and applies evenly without leaving droplets or traces. Lightweight and breathable on skin

• Up to 36 hours transfer-resistant wear. Sweat and smudge-resistant. Face, Eye and Lip makeup resists transfer all day

• Spray in a circular motion for 3 to 4 seconds for an easy and even application. Leaves a natural healthy glow finish

• Spray does not leave a white cast, mark or settle, and prevents makeup from cracking, flaking, or caking', 1450, 1450, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Loreal-Paris.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Loreal-Paris.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Dove Sensitive Antiperspirant Deodorant Stick', 'dove-sensitive-antiperspirant-deodorant-stick', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'fragrance'), 'Dove', 'Gentle on skin, tough on sweat. Dove Sensitive Antiperspirant Stick offers all-day odor and sweat protection with 0% alcohol and ¼ moisturizers – perfect for sensitive underarms.', 'Dove Invisible Solid Sensitive Antiperspirant Deodorant Stick is your go-to for gentle yet effective underarm care. Designed specifically for sensitive skin, it provides all-day sweat and odor protection while helping your skin recover from shaving irritation. With 0% alcohol (ethanol) and ¼ moisturizers, it soothes and softens delicate underarms. The light, clean fragrance is custom-made for sensitive skin, and the solid formula glides on smoothly for effortless application. Stay fresh, dry, and confident – with care you can trust.', 450, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Dove.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Dove.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Anti-Perspirant Deodorant"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi Gloss Royale', 'bellaoggi-gloss-royale', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'A non-sticky, glossy gel balm enriched with royal jelly for soft, plump, and brilliantly shiny lips — available in 8 fresh, fruit-inspired fragrances.', 'Bellaoggi Gloss Royale is a creamy gel balm that delivers a high-shine finish while keeping your lips nourished and comfortable. Infused with royal jelly, its non-sticky texture hydrates deeply and leaves lips looking fuller, smoother, and irresistibly glossy. With 8 fruity fragrances, it’s both a beauty treat and a soothing balm in one.', 1250, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/flashy-pink.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/flashy-pink.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["001 Chillout Nude","002 Crystal Nude","003 Peachy Nude","004 Venus Pink","005 Baby Rose","006 Sugar Pink","007 Holiday Red","008 Flashy Pink"]'::jsonb, '["lip gloss"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi My Skin Velvet Touch 24H', 'bellaoggi-my-skin-velvet-touch-24h', '71425014', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'A long-lasting compact powder foundation for a smooth, matte finish. Enriched with Camellia Extract, Hyaluronic Acid, and corn starch to hydrate, plump, and control oil—perfect for all skin types.', 'Bellaoggi My Skin Velvet Touch 24H is a compact powder foundation designed for all-day comfort and flawless wear. Its silky formula delivers a natural matte finish while evening out skin tone. Infused with moisturizing Camellia Extract and Hyaluronic Acid for a soft, plumped effect, it also includes sebum-absorbing corn starch to keep shine under control—ideal even for oily skin types. A must-have for on-the-go touch-ups.', 3050, 3050, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/My-Skin-Touch-Velvet-24H-LINEN.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/My-Skin-Touch-Velvet-24H-LINEN.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["10N IVORY","15C NATURAL BEIGE","15N LINEN","15W GOLDEN BEIGE"]'::jsonb, '["Compact Powder"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi Feel Glow Concealer', 'bellaoggi-feel-glow-concealer', '71425029', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'A high-coverage, illuminating concealer enriched with Avocado Oil and SPF 15. Brightens tired eyes, reduces dark circles, and smooths skin for a naturally radiant look.', 'Bellaoggi Feel Glow Concealer is a silky, high-coverage formula designed to brighten dull skin and reduce intense dark circles. Enriched with Avocado Oil and SPF 15, it nourishes and protects while seamlessly blending into the skin. Its lightweight, fragrance-free texture smooths and corrects imperfections, giving a radiant and refreshed appearance. With its precise applicator, Feel Glow instantly illuminates shadow areas and erases signs of fatigue, leaving your complexion even, smooth, and naturally glowing.', 1750, 1750, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/sweet-honey.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/sweet-honey.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["DESERT DREAM","GLOWING SAND","GOLDEN BEIGE","RADIANT FAIR","RADIANT NUDE","SWEET HONEY"]'::jsonb, '["concealer"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi COVERPRO 24H', 'bellaoggi-coverpro-24h', '71425028', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'A high-coverage, 24-hour wear concealer with a precision flat-bristle brush that corrects, sculpts, and brightens in one smooth stroke. Blends seamlessly for a natural, flawless finish.', 'Bellaoggi COVERPRO 24H is a long-lasting concealer with a professional flat-bristle applicator for precise, easy application. Its creamy, lightweight texture offers high coverage while blending effortlessly into the skin, concealing imperfections, under-eye circles, and uneven tone. Designed with 6 versatile shades to match all skin types, it provides a natural, smooth finish while protecting your skin from environmental stress. Perfect for sculpting, highlighting, and year-round wear.', 2200, 2200, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/cookies.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/cookies.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["001 IVORY","002 SAND","003 NOUGAT","004 HONEY","005 TOFFEE","006 COOKIES"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Derma Co Pore Minimizing Priming Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ &#8211; 80g', 'derma-co-pore-minimizing-priming-sunscreen-spf-50-pa-80g', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Derma', 'Packed with the superpowers of Niacinamide & P-Refinyl, this sunscreen limits excessive oil production and reduces the appearance of dilated pores.', 'Derma Co Pore Minimizing Priming Sunscreen mattifies your skin and reduces the appearance of enlarged pores, giving your skin a smoother look. The powerful combination of ingredients such as SPF 50 & PA+++, Niacinamide, P-Refinyl®, and Seboclear mp™ which preps your skin for makeup, lightens dark patches, evens out your skin tone, and boosts collagen production.

Niacinamide is a potent ingredient that helps soak excess oil or sweat from the skin, preventing your makeup from melting. P-Refinyl® reduces the appearance of slacked pores, while Seboclear mp™ gently treats blackheads and inhibits the growth of acne-causing bacteria, thus driving out excess oil from your skin.

This 80g sunscreen has a quick-absorbing formula that penetrates the skin, ensuring no white residue. Its antioxidant-rich formula glides on your skin like butter and shields it from damage caused by UVA and UVB rays. We recommend applying sunscreen spf 50 safe and gentle sunscreen every day for the best results.', 955, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Derma-SPF-50.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Derma-SPF-50.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Bellaoggi My Skin Tone Foundation', 'bellaoggi-my-skin-tone-foundation', '71425011', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'Bellaoggi My Skin Tone Foundation with SPF 15 is a perfect foundation for hiding imperfections and evening out the irregular tone of the face while maintaining its natural brightness thanks to a micro-fine powder with a soft focus effect th', 'Discover MY SKIN TONE, the universal long-wear, no-transfer foundation that blends evenly with the complexion, fixing perfectly on the skin. Its light and non-occlusive fluid hydrating texture blends perfectly with the skin tone and undertone for super natural coverage and a delicately demi-matte finish. The formula of MY SKIN TONE paraben free is enriched with precious active ingredients. The oat extract with a tightening effect makes the skin more toned and relaxed; the natural derivative of nasturtium flowers instead promotes the skin’s oxygenation process and visibly improves its brightness and vitality; finally, the innovative presence of a mix of fruit extracts ensures hydration and nourishment for hours. Bellaoggi My Skin Tone Foundation with SPF 15 is a perfect foundation for hiding imperfections and evening out the irregular tone of the face while maintaining its natural brightness thanks to a micro-fine powder with a soft focus effect that gives the skin a smooth and radiant appearance without gray areas . The foundation with modular coverage thanks to its hydrophobically treated mineral fillers ensures redefined and long-lasting skin.

Bellaoggi My Skin Tone Foundation available in 12 color adapting shades perfect for all skin types is the ideal foundation for all occasions! For hydrated, luminous and smooth skin for longer, try MY SKIN TONE and let yourself be won over by its precious 30 ml transparent glass bottle.', 3150, 3150, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/dunes-1.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/dunes-1.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["00N PORCELAIN","05N NEUTRAL FAIR","10C SAND","10N IVORY","15C NATURAL BEIGE","15N LINEN","15W GOLDEN BEIGE","20C AMBER","20N VANILLA ROSE","20W GOLD SAND","25N VANILLA","25W DUNE"]'::jsonb, '["foundation"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Bellaoggi My Skin Mat 12H Foundation', 'bellaoggi-my-skin-mat-12h-foundation', '71425012', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Bellaoggi', 'Make sure your skin looks naturally beautiful and healthy with Bellaoggi My Skin Mat 12H Foundation; choose your favourite shade out of the three available.', 'A perfectly smooth and mattified skin, guaranteeing an excellent coverage up to 12 hours with MY SKIN MAT 12H, a fluid and matte finish foundation.

It’s no transfer texture melts on face leaving the skin soft and giving an extremely natural and perfect final effect.

The perfect combination of matte and velvet finish as well as the excellent coverage, provide a uniform, smooth complexion together with an impeccable hold.

The balanced combination of oils and volatile silicones with our innovative long-lasting ingredients ensures up to 12h flawless product.

Make sure your skin looks naturally beautiful and healthy with My Skin Mat 12H Foundation; choose your favourite shade out of the three available.', 3150, 3150, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/neutral-rosy.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/neutral-rosy.png"]'::jsonb, 'Bellaoggi Shades', '["001 COOL NUDE","002 NEUTRAL ROSY","003 WARM BEIGE"]'::jsonb, '["foundation"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Loreal Infallible 24H Tinted Serum Foundation', 'loreal-infallible-24h-tinted-serum-foundation', '71103238', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Loreal', 'L’Oréal Infallible 24H Tinted Serum Foundation combines skincare and makeup with 1% Hyaluronic Acid for hydrated, natural-looking coverage. Available at ColorPlus Cosmetics in 6 shades specially chosen for Nepali and Indian skintones.', 'Discover the perfect fusion of skincare and makeup with L’Oréal Infallible 24H Tinted Serum Foundation — now available at ColorPlus Cosmetics! Infused with 1% Hyaluronic Acid, this lightweight serum foundation offers long-lasting hydration while blurring imperfections for a smooth, radiant finish. It’s never cakey, never dry — just dewy, fresh-looking skin all day long.

We’ve selected 6 shades that suit a wide range of Nepali and Indian skintones, making it easy to find your perfect match. Apply a single layer on freshly moisturized skin and blend seamlessly for undetectable, breathable coverage that lasts.

Your skin, but better — the skincare foundation hybrid your routine needs!', 1850, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/infalliable-serum-light.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/infalliable-serum-light.png"]'::jsonb, 'Shade', '["0.5 - 2 Very Light","1-2 Rosy Light","2-3 Light","6-7 Tan","Light Medium 3-4","Medium 4-5"]'::jsonb, '["foundation"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Sheglam All-In-One Volume & Length Mascara', 'sheglam-all-in-one-volume-length-mascara', '71113145', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Sheglam', 'SHEGLAM’s All-in-One Volume & Length Mascara is available in two types—Waterproof and Washable. Each features a dual-ended brush that lets you customize your lash look with intense volume, length, and curl. Smudgeproof, clump-free, and quic', 'SHEGLAM’s All-in-One Volume & Length Mascara delivers freedom, versatility, and stunning results in one sleek tube. Choose between Waterproof for all-day, stay-put wear or Washable for easy removal and everyday comfort.

Each mascara features a dual-ended brush, designed to let you personalize your lash effect—build volume, stretch length, enhance curl, or do it all. The clump-free, smudgeproof, and quick-drying formula ensures a flawless finish that lasts.

Whether you’re going soft and natural or bold and dramatic, Sheglam gives you the power to shape your lashes your way.', 1350, 1350, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Waterproof.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Waterproof.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Shades', '["Washable Black","Waterproof"]'::jsonb, '["mascara"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('LA Colors Rad Rouge Blush', 'la-colors-rad-rouge-blush', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'LA Colors', 'Formulated to apply smoothly with just the right amount of pigment that is blendable so you can easily create a natural, healthy looking glow or rad dramatic looks.', 'Instantly brighten up with any of our new 16 iconic blush shades! Formulated to apply smoothly with just the right amount of pigment that is blendable so you can easily create a natural, healthy looking glow or rad dramatic looks. Compact & convenient, includes mirror & brush applicator.', 550, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CBL724-Bodacious.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CBL724-Bodacious.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Shade', '["CBL724 Bodacious","CBL725 Valley Girl","CBL732 Poppin"]'::jsonb, '["blush"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('L.A Girl Primer Spray', 'l-a-girl-primer-spray', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'L.A', 'Primer spray contains glycerin & botanical purslane extract to hydrate & soothe skin. Spray primer before makeup application to prep skin.', 'Prime, set and shine with ease just spray! Primer spray contains glycerin & botanical purslane extract to hydrate & soothe skin. Spray primer before makeup application to prep skin.', 1300, 1050, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Primer-Spray.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Primer-Spray.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('CeraVe Moisturizing Cream 340g', 'cerave-moisturizing-cream-340g', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'CeraVe', 'CeraVe Moisturizing Cream is a rich, non-greasy, fast-absorbing moisturizer with three essential ceramides that lock in skin’s moisture and help maintain the skin’s protective barrier.', 'CeraVe Moisturizing Cream is a rich, non-greasy, fast-absorbing moisturizer for normal to dry skin on the face and body. Formulated with three essential ceramides, it works to lock in skin’s moisture and help maintain your skin’s protective barrier. Our moisturizing cream also features hyaluronic acid, petrolatum, and MVE Delivery Technology—which works by continually releasing moisturizing ingredients for long-lasting hydration. Developed with dermatologists, this barrier-restoring cream is gentle on skin, fragrance-free, and accepted by the National Eczema Association.', 3250, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cerave-moisturizing-cream-3essential.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cerave-moisturizing-cream-3essential.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["moisturising cream"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Maybelline Super Stay up to 24HR Hybrid Powder-Foundation', 'maybelline-super-stay-up-to-24hr-hybrid-powder-foundation', '71113539', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'Maybelline', 'Maybelline New York’s Super Stay up to 24HR Hybrid Powder-Foundation. This medium-to-full coverage superhero hybrid delivers up to 24 hours of super staying power.', 'Get your soft-matte look with Maybelline New York’s Super Stay up to 24HR Hybrid Powder-Foundation. This medium-to-full coverage superhero hybrid delivers up to 24 hours of super staying power. Fueled by Super resistant hybrid technology, its formula unites the best of both worlds: the performance of a liquid with the comfort of a powder. Super lightweight, super comfortable feel. Longwear that is sweat-resistant, water-resistant, and transfer-resistant. Resists caking and patchiness. Just swipe it on and you’re ready to take on the city!', 1950, 1950, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Maybelline-24Hr-Hybrid-Powder-Foundation-110.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Maybelline-24Hr-Hybrid-Powder-Foundation-110.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Shades', '["102","110","112","118","120","130","310","312"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
