    ('Simple Vital Vitamin Day Cream SPF 15', 'simple-vital-vitamin-day-cream-spf-15', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Simple', 'Give your skin a daily dose of nourishment with Simple Vital Vitamin Day Cream — a lightweight, non-greasy moisturizer designed to hydrate and refresh your skin without any harsh chemicals. Perfect for sensitive skin, this day cream is enri', 'Give your skin a daily dose of nourishment with Simple Vital Vitamin Day Cream — a lightweight, non-greasy moisturizer designed to hydrate and refresh your skin without any harsh chemicals. Perfect for sensitive skin, this day cream is enriched with Pro-Vitamins B5, E, and Glycerin, helping you achieve soft, smooth, and healthy-looking skin all day long.

