    ('Peace Out Pores Minimizing Strips', 'peace-out-pores-minimizing-strips', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'tools-accessories'), 'Peace', 'Enlarged and clogged pores got you tossing and turning? Rest easy—we’ll minimize their appearance in no time. These two-in-one nose and pore strips contain a NEW, clean hydrocolloid polymer technology to lift away dirt, excess sebum, and de', 'Enlarged and clogged pores got you tossing and turning? Rest easy—we’ll minimize their appearance in no time. These two-in-one nose and pore strips contain a NEW, clean hydrocolloid polymer technology to lift away dirt, excess sebum, and dead skin cells. Pore-minimizing strips extract excess oil while DMAE helps visibly shrink enlarged pores. Once oil and impurities have been absorbed into the strip, Retinol* helps refine skin texture and helps minimize the chance of clogged up pores from forming.

How To Use 

Apply a nose strip or pore strip, tacky-side down, on clean, dry skin. After four to six hours, gently remove the strip.* *Results may vary.

Hold up! If you’re experiencing any areas of excessive dryness, open skin or went a little heavy handed with peels/chemical exfoliation/actives, give your skin a little resting time before using our dots or patches.', 1950, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/peace-out-pores.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/peace-out-pores.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Pores Minimizing Strips"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Beauty Of Joseon Relief Sun Aqua -Fresh Rice+B5 Spf 50+ PA++++ (50ml)', 'beauty-of-joseon-relief-sun-aqua-fresh-riceb5-spf-50-pa-50ml', '71120331', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Beauty of Joseon', 'An extra hydrating version of Beauty of Joseon’s popular Relief Sun sunscreen, Relief Sun Aqua-fresh boasts a lightweight and refreshing liquid formula that won’t leave a white cast or sticky residue. The chemical sunscreen boasts SPF 50+ P', 'An extra hydrating version of Beauty of Joseon’s popular Relief Sun sunscreen, Relief Sun Aqua-fresh boasts a lightweight and refreshing liquid formula that won’t leave a white cast or sticky residue. The chemical sunscreen boasts SPF 50+ PA++++ sun protection. It’s formulated with 30% rice seed water, along with colloidal oatmeal and panthenol to soothe and revitalize skin. Suitable for all skin types.

­­­­Benefits:

• A more hydrated version of Beauty of Joseon’s best loving sunscreen protects all skin type users from strong UV rays with SPF 50+ PA++++ broad spectrum.

• Formulated with Panthenol to enhance skin moisture barrier and offer instant calming effect to irritated and dry skin especially under strong sun rays.

• Enriched with Rice Seed Water to gently nourish skin and promote a healthy-looking and plump complexion.

• Features a lightweight fluid-type texture that leaves a refreshing finish without any white cast or sticky feeling.

• Suitable for all skin types especially for oily to combination skin users.

How to Use:

As the last step of your skincare routine, apply a moderate amount onto your skin evenly and reapply every 3-5 hours.', 1850, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/BOJ-Sun-SPF50-Aqua-Rice.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/BOJ-Sun-SPF50-Aqua-Rice.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Beauty Of Joseon","Relief Sun Aqua -Fresh","Rice+B5","Spf 50+ PA++++ (50ml)"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Beauty Of Joseon Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask', 'beauty-of-joseon-ground-rice-and-honey-glow-mask', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'bath-body'), 'Beauty of Joseon', 'Discover the power of rice and honey with our new wash-off mask, the Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask. This mask harnesses the power of upcycled makgeolli lees, a byproduct of traditional Korean rice wine, to deliver potent skin benefits. En', 'Discover the power of rice and honey with our new wash-off mask, the Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask. This mask harnesses the power of upcycled makgeolli lees, a byproduct of traditional Korean rice wine, to deliver potent skin benefits. Enriched with natural rice hull powder and 5% honey, it provides deep hydration, improves skin texture, and helps soothe inflammatory skin conditions like acne.

How To Use

After cleansing, apply evenly to a dry face. After 15-20 minutes, gently roll with lukewarm water to wash off.', 2250, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Ground-Rice-Honey-Glow-Mask.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Ground-Rice-Honey-Glow-Mask.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Axis Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Toner', 'axis-y-dark-spot-correcting-glow-toner', '71120330', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Axis', 'Unlike ordinary toners, our Dark Spot Correcting Glow Toner features a unique dual-layer formula that delivers essential moisture, oil, and potent brightening ingredients deep into your skin. Packaged in a convenient facial mist, it ensures', 'Unlike ordinary toners, our Dark Spot Correcting Glow Toner features a unique dual-layer formula that delivers essential moisture, oil, and potent brightening ingredients deep into your skin. Packaged in a convenient facial mist, it ensures a soothing, non-irritating application perfect for even the most sensitive skin. Containing 98% pure Glutathione raw material, 5% Niacinamide, and a water-soluble Vitamin C derivative, this toner effectively reduces melanin production, revealing a clearer, more radiant complexion. Achieve visibly brighter, more glowing skin with a toner that’s as gentle as it is powerful.

How To Use

Step 1. Shake well to mix the serum and toner layers thoroughly.

Step 2. Close your eyes and spray evenly over your entire face, allowing the fine mist to absorb into your skin.

Step 3. Use immediately after cleansing or makeup application to lock in hydration and achieve a dewy, lasting glow.', 2050, 2050, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-Toner-125ml-Dark-Spot-Correcting-Glow.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-Toner-125ml-Dark-Spot-Correcting-Glow.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Dark Spot Correcting Glow Toner"]'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE),
    ('Axis Y PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel', 'axis-y-pha-resurfacing-glow-peel', '71120334', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Axis', 'Increased exposure to pollution, pollen, and other external aggressors can be tough for our skin to fight. More dirt and dead skin accumulation on the surface of the skin leads to rough, dull skin that doesn’t absorb skincare products effec', 'Increased exposure to pollution, pollen, and other external aggressors can be tough for our skin to fight. More dirt and dead skin accumulation on the surface of the skin leads to rough, dull skin that doesn’t absorb skincare products effectively.

Of course, our natural instinct was to try to develop a solution to this problem. We wanted to formulate a product that would make the skin feel purified, soothed, and most importantly, clean. This is what led to the creation of our PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel.

How To Use

Step 1. After cleansing, apply a thick even layer onto dry skin.

Step 2. Allow it to sit for 10 to 15 minutes.

Step 3. Rinse with lukewarm water.', 1850, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-PHA-Resurfacing-Glow-Peel-.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-PHA-Resurfacing-Glow-Peel-.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
    ('Axis Y Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack', 'axis-y-mugwort-pore-clarifying-wash-off-pack', '71120336', (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Axis', '#StayStrongCampaign to support the fight against COVID-19 in communities worldwide. Through our new product, we wanted to add a relaxing, meditative, self-care moment for those that are spending more time at home during the pandemic. We als', '#StayStrongCampaign to support the fight against COVID-19 in communities worldwide. Through our new product, we wanted to add a relaxing, meditative, self-care moment for those that are spending more time at home during the pandemic. We also noticed members of our communities suffering from skin problems caused by everyday mask wear, dubbed by social media as “maskne”. We formulated our wash off pack with ingredients to help treat these stressful and painful skin irritations.

How To Use

Step 1. Use the provided spatula or our No-Mess Masking Spatula to scoop an adequate amount onto a clean, dry face

Step 2. Apply an even layer to face, avoiding the immediate area around the eyes and mouth

Step 3. Allow to dry and harden for approximately 15 minutes and rinse off with lukewarm water', 1850, 1850, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-Nugwort-Pore-Clarigying-Wash-Off-Pack-.jpg', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Axis-Y-Nugwort-Pore-Clarigying-Wash-Off-Pack-.jpg"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Mugwort Pore Clarifying","Wash Off Pack"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
