    ('RCMA Makeup Translucent Powder', 'rcma-makeup-translucent-powder', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'makeup'), 'RCMA', 'RCMA Makeup Translucent Powder is a must-have for every professional makeup kit. This no-color powder with a slight flesh tone keeps foundations set and dry without the caked-on look, offering a smooth, flawless finish.', 'RCMA Makeup Translucent Powder is a pro-grade loose powder designed to set your foundation with a natural, flawless finish. Known for its lightweight, non-caking formula, this no-color powder is ideal for keeping your makeup in place while allowing your skin to breathe. The added pigment provides a subtle flesh tone, ensuring a seamless blend that works with various skin tones.

