    ('Plum 2% Niacinamide & Rice Water Simply Bright Face Wash', 'plum-2-niacinamide-rice-water-simply-bright-face-wash', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Plum', 'Plum 2% Niacinamide & Rice Water Simply Bright Face Wash brightens and softens skin with 2% Niacinamide and Rice Water, leaving your skin refreshed and clean. Its gentle, sulfate-free formula hydrates and balances skin without stripping nat', 'Plum 2% Niacinamide & Rice Water Simply Bright Face Wash is designed to brighten dull skin while maintaining its natural balance. Powered by 2% Niacinamide, it targets uneven skin tone, leaving your skin fresh and radiant. Rice Water and Rice Ferment Extract work together to smoothen skin texture and improve elasticity, while Inositol (Vitamin B8) enhances skin’s natural bounce.

This gentle, sulfate-free face wash hydrates with ingredients like hyaluronic acid and pro-vitamin B5, effectively cleansing dirt and impurities without stripping your skin’s natural oils. Suitable for all skin types, it’s your go-to cleanser for a healthy, bright, and refreshed complexion.

How to Use:

Lather a coin-sized amount on a wet face, rinse off, and pat dry. Follow with toner, serum, moisturizer, and sunscreen in the AM. For best results, use twice daily.', 475, NULL, 25, 5, 'https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/plum-face-wash.png', '["https://colorpluscosmetics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/plum-face-wash.png"]'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '["Face Wash"]'::jsonb, TRUE, FALSE),
