    ('Plum Bodylovin’ Vanilla Vibes Body Oil', 'plum-bodylovin-vanilla-vibes-body-oil', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Plum', 'Plum BodyLovin’ Vanilla Vibes Body Oil is a lightweight, non-greasy formula enriched with 9 nourishing oils to deeply moisturize and smoothen skin. Absorbs quickly, leaving skin soft, hydrated, and glowing with a warm vanilla fragrance.', 'Plum BodyLovin’ Vanilla Vibes Body Oil provides intense hydration while keeping skin lightweight and non-sticky. Formulated with 9 nourishing oils, it absorbs quickly, locking in moisture for smooth, soft, and radiant skin. The warm vanilla fragrance adds a subtle, comforting scent.

