    ('Well 10 Anti Acne Night Care', 'well-10-anti-acne-night-care', NULL, (SELECT id FROM public.product_categories WHERE slug = 'skincare'), 'Well 10', 'Overnight Healing for Clearer, Calmer Skin', 'Well 10 Anti Acne Night Care
Overnight Healing for Clearer, Calmer Skin
Wake up to healthier, blemish-free skin with Well 10 Anti Acne Night Care, an intensive night moisturizer and treatment that works while you sleep. This rich yet non-greasy formula helps to heal active breakouts, fade acne scars, and restore skin’s natural balance by morning.
Key Benefits
• Overnight Acne Treatment – Salicylic acid and retinol gently exfoliate and unclog pores.
• Reduces Inflammation – Niacinamide and chamomile calm redness and irritation.
• Scar Repair and Renewal – Vitamin C and licorice extract help fade acne marks and even skin tone.
• Hydration and Recovery – Hyaluronic acid and ceramides restore moisture and repair the skin barrier.
• Oil-Free Formula – Lightweight, fast-absorbing, and non-comedogenic to prevent clogged pores.
Why It Works
• Fights acne while promoting skin renewal overnight.
• Soothes and nourishes without causing dryness.
• Safe for sensitive, oily, and acne-prone skin.
How to Use
Apply to clean skin after using Well 10 Anti Acne Toner or serum. Gently massage into the face and neck. Use nightly as part of your bedtime routine.
